<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-HIH Winterthur half yr net profit up.</title>
<headline>RTRS-HIH Winterthur half yr net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     40.1 vs 22.5</p>
<p>    Net					26.1 vs 15.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     7.00 vs 6.00</p>
<p>NOTE: HIH Winterthur International Holdings Ltd is about 48 percent owned by Winterther Swiss Insurance Company.  </p>
<p>    Sales				  667.1  vs 306.9</p>
<p>    Other income			 229.7  vs  97.3</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    8.9  vs   8.0</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked</p>
<p>Pay date Oct 11</p>
<p>Reg date Sept 27</p>
<p>    Tax				     14.0  vs   7.4</p>
<p>    Interest				 1.7  vs nil</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   4.7  vs   2.5</p>
<p>    Minorities			     nil  vs nil</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
